  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8403.01 Obtaining and Completing Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8403.01 Obtaining and Completing Application.\n\n(a) Application forms may be obtained from www.nhsp.dos.nh.gov/resources/documents-and-forms; or in person, during business hours, from the:\n\nDivision of State Police\n\nPermits and Licensing\n\n33 Hazen Dr. - 1st floor\n\nConcord, NH 03305.\n\n(b) An applicant applying on their own behalf shall submit completed Form DSSP 470 “Application Form on Behalf of Yourself”, effective 08/25 and:\n\n(1) Acknowledge they are voluntarily providing contact information for and designating the contact person(s) named to assist with communications during an encounter with law enforcement; and\n\n(2) The applicant’s signature shall be notarized.\n\n(c) A parent applying on behalf of a minor who has a disability, or a legal guardian applying on behalf of a person with a disability, shall submit completed Form DSSP 471 “Application Form for Parent of Minor or for Legal Guardian of Person with a Disability”, effective 08/25, and:\n\n(1) Acknowledge they are the parent or legal guardian of the minor or ward named on the application;\n\n(2) Acknowledge that they are voluntarily providing contact information for and designating the contact person(s) named to assist the minor or ward with communications during an encounter with law enforcement; and\n\n(3) The applicant’s signature shall be notarized.\n\n(4) Include the following documentation where applicable:\n\na. If the applicant is a parent of a minor, include a copy of one of the following:\n\n1. The minor’s birth certificate;\n\n2. Certificate of adoption; or\n\n3. Adoption decree; or\n\nb. If the applicant is a legal guardian, include a copy of the order appointing the guardianship that shows the powers granted to the legal guardian.\n\n(d) Applicants shall submit completed applications by:\n\n(1) Mailing to:\n\nDivision of State Police\n\nAttn: NCIC\n\n33 Hazen Dr. – 2nd Floor\n\nConcord, NH 03305;\n\n(2) Hand delivering during business hours to:\n\nDivision of State Police\n\nPermits and Licensing\n\n33 Hazen Dr. – 1st floor\n\nConcord, NH 03305; or\n\nb. Any troop station; or\n\n(3) Emailing to: NCIC@dos.nh.gov\n\nSource. #14340, eff 8-14-25, EXPIRES: 8-14-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8400.html"
}
